            <ArticleTitle>Adipose Hypertrophy Following Cryolipolysis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>NP218-20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1093/asj/sjv069</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Cryolipolysis has become a popular non-invasive treatment for unwanted fatty collections. The benefits are minimal down time, short recovery time, and decreased pain, although pain is the most frequent complaint. The author recently treated a patient who presented with an enlarging adipose collection on his lower abdomen following cryolipolysis with CoolSculpting(®) (ZELTIQ Aesthetics, Inc., Pleasanton, CA).</AbstractText>
